      ],
      "summary_en": "Bard fires a missile which will slow the first enemy struck, and continue onward. If it strikes a wall, it will stun the initial target; if it strikes another enemy, it will stun them both.",
      "summary_zh": "巴德发射一束能量弹，减速命中的第一个敌人，并继续向前。如果能量弹命中墙体，它还会使首个目标晕眩；如果它命中了另一个敌人，那么它会让这两个敌人都晕眩。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1306861:4037681"
      ]
